  "description": "Sebastian Ghiorghiu made millions and grew his YouTube channel to 1M subscribers, but then started doubting whether he could build a \"real\" business, without showing his face on camera. To prove himself, he built an app that now makes $250K/year.\n\n🛠️ Want to build your own app with AI? Check out Starter Story Build → https://build.starterstory.com/build/ai-build-accelerator?utm_source=youtube&utm_campaign=deven\n\nSebastian's app: https://www.helloatlas.io/\nFollow Sebastian: https://www.youtube.com/c/SebastianGhiorghiu\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: ‪@StarterStoryBuild‬ \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Intro\n1:17 - Who is Sebastian\n1:48 - Building a \"real\" business\n2:36 - Life as an influencer\n3:17 - Why Sebastian stopped making videos\n4:36 - Why SaaS?\n5:56 - Building the business\n7:12 - Does audience really matter?\n8:22 - \"Real\" business: pros & cons\n9:57 - Sebastian's identity shift\n10:31 - Build an audience or a \"real\" business?\n11:28 - Growth from 0 to $250K/month\n12:51 - Did influencer skills help?\n13:37 - \"Failure is normal\"\n\nThis video is an educational case study of one founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.",
